      "description": "Careers at Coastal | Coastal Carolina Skip to main content Coastal Carolina Toggle menu Academics & Research arrow down Academics & Research Academic Program Finder Academic Programs Colleges Academic Advising Education Abroad Coastal Student Success Center Experiential Learning University Libraries Registrar Research Academics & Research Home Admissions & Aid arrow down Admissions & Aid Undergraduate Admissions Visit Campus Graduate Admissions Financial Aid Transfer Admission Meet Your Admissions Counselor International Admissions Merit Awards Enroll at CCU Residency Scholarships Orientation Tuition & Fees Admissions and Aid Home Campus Life arrow down Campus Life Activities & Organizations Recreation Student Affairs Bookstore Campus Dining University Housing LiveWell Lib Jackson Student Union International Students Safety & Security Campus Life Home Athletics About arrow down About Around CCU Campus Map CCU Traditions Visit Campus University Leadership University Calendar Advancement Employment Opportunities News CCU Directory: Inside CCU A-Z CHANT411 Contact Us About CCU Home MyCCU Current Students Faculty & Staff Families Events Alumni Services & Support Request Info Visit Apply Give Toggle search Search Search Search Popular Searches Housing Living Options Visit Campus Academic Programs Moodle Housing and Meal Plan Rates Coastal Carolinar Academics & Research arrow down Academics & Research Academic Program Finder Academic Programs Colleges Academic Advising Education Abroad Coastal Student Success Center Experiential Learning University Libraries Registrar Research Academics & Research Home Admissions & Aid arrow down Admissions & Aid Undergraduate Admissions Visit Campus Graduate Admissions Financial Aid Transfer Admission Meet Your Admissions Counselor International Admissions Merit Awards Enroll at CCU Residency Scholarships Orientation Tuition & Fees Admissions and Aid Home Campus Life arrow down Campus Life Activities & Organizations Recreation Student Affairs Bookstore Campus Dining University Housing LiveWell Lib Jackson Student Union International Students Safety & Security Campus Life Home Athletics About arrow down About Around CCU Campus Map CCU Traditions Visit Campus University Leadership University Calendar Advancement Employment Opportunities News CCU Directory: Inside CCU A-Z CHANT411 Contact Us About CCU Home Toggle search Search Search Search Popular Searches Housing Living Options Visit Campus Academic Programs Moodle Housing and Meal Plan Rates Careers at Coastal Home — Human Resources — Careers at Coastal Home — Human Resources — Careers at Coastal Careers at Coastal Carolina University Thank you for considering employment with Coastal Carolina University (CCU). CCU is ranked among the best employers in South Carolina according to Forbes annual list of America’s Best Employers by State. CCU ranked No. 23 in the state for 2023. We are also one of three universities in South Carolina to receive this recognition. Located in beautiful Conway, SC, you will feel right at home. Interested in working at Coastal Carolina University? APPLY NOW! Apply Now Want to learn more about CCU? Check out these resources! About Conway Working at CCU Pay Grades Benefits and Insurance Employment FAQs E-Verify Coastal Carolina University conducts background checks and participates in E-Verify . Applicants with Disabilities Individuals with disabilities may request reasonable accommodation(s) in the application, interview, and employment process. For more information, please contact the University's Office of Human Resources at 843-349-2139 or at jobs@coastal.edu . Veterans South Carolina is making our veterans a priority for employment in state agencies and institutions. Click here for eligibility requirements. Equal Employment Opportunity Coastal Carolina University is committed to ensuring that all persons are able to learn, work, and enjoy a workplace, educational, and living environment that is free from discriminatory harassment, treatment, or services. The policy of equality extends to both the employment practices and administration of programs and activities within the University. It applies to (1) persons who wish to participate in and benefit from programs and activities along with those who are not participants, and (2) persons seeking employment and those employed. Discrimination based on race, color, religion, sex, on the basis of pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions, national origin, age, genetic information, mental or physical disability, or status as a disabled veteran or veteran of the Vietnam era is prohibited. In addition, Coastal Carolina University prohibits discrimination based on sexual orientation, gender identity, and gender expression. It is the policy of Coastal Carolina University that no person be excluded from participation in, or be denied the benefits of, or in any way be subject to, discrimination in any program or activity of the University. It is also the policy of the University to recruit, hire, train, and promote employees without unlawful discrimination. More information can be found at this link: Equal Employment Opportunity . Coastal Carolina University Physical: 100 Chanticleer Dr. E, Conway, SC Mailing: P.O. Box 261954, Conway, SC 29528 843-347-3161 Youtube Instagram Facebook Twitter LinkedIn Contact Us Library Bookstore University Leadership Directory Employment Opportunities Campus Safety & Security Youtube Instagram Facebook Twitter LinkedIn Copyright © Coastal Carolina University Site Policies EEO Title IX Accessibility Coastal Carolina University prohibits any form of discrimination against its students, faculty, staff\r\n            and applicants in its programs or for admission to or employment with the University."
    },
